abstract: "Version 5.4.0 was submitted to the Chrome Web Store on 2026-11-16 and is in review. PromptDC is an AI prompt & writing assistant that enhances any text you select anywhere on any website — including read-only pages — and rewrites it in place in editable fields. Writing profiles handle grammar, tone, email, and social; the Code profile is a prompt rewriter that uses one editable system prompt across coding tools to turn vague requests into implementation-ready instructions for AI code generation across all major LLMs."

